# Start a race, begin its countdown, drive, pause, return to the menu, and exit.
at 190 mouse 0 40 0
at 200 mouse 0 0 1
at 201 mouse 0 0 0
at 300 key ENTER down
at 301 key ENTER up
at 500 key W down
at 550 key W up
at 700 key ESC down
at 701 key ESC up
at 720 mouse 0 -115 0
at 740 mouse 0 0 1
at 741 mouse 0 0 0
at 780 mouse 0 0 1
at 781 mouse 0 0 0
